Here at Magic Bill's Compleat Polymorph Shoppe, we like to remind
our customers that polymorphing isn't intrinsically a Bad Thing.
In particular, being an Ogre Lord can be great - you're a pretty
heavy-duty character.  
It does help to KNOW when you're going to be polymorphed,
or to be wearing one of our nice rings of polymorph control,
so you won't be wearing your good armor when it happens,
or so you can turn into something that won't damage the armor.
It's also nice to turn into Big Tough Nasty Things instead of
turning into a Garter Snake.  

But if you don't like it, just wait a while, and pray occasionally.

If you polymorph into a unicorn, is it lucky to throw gems at yourself?

